# Translation of the Museum of Alternative Displays into 日本語.
# How to work on this file: TRANSLATING.md at the top of the repository.
# 
# 日本語. Polite です・ます style, with the visitor never named by a pronoun.
# A hall is a 展示室 and a piece is a 展示品. The device as a kind is a ディスプレイ, a picture surface is a 画面, a board is a 表示機 or パネル.
# Figures are written in half-width digits. Large round numbers use 万 and 億 with one figure in front (1.3億台), so that the check can read them.
# Buttons named in a text stand in 「」 and are spelled as on the button.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: Museum of Alternative Displays\n"
"Report-Msgid-Bugs-To: https://github.com/obartra/museum-of-alternative-displays/issues\n"
"Language: ja\n"
"Language-Team: 日本語\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\n"

