#: interface
#. About page.
msgctxt "ui.about.tour"
msgid "The guided tour was written for this museum. It adds no facts to the labels, only the thread from one to the next. Where it can be heard, the voice is synthetic: it is made with ElevenLabs from the words shown beside it."
msgstr "ガイドツアーは、この博物館のために書いたものです。ラベルにない事実は加えず、ラベルからラベルへの筋道だけを加えています。音声で聞ける場合、その声は合成音声です。横に表示している言葉から、ElevenLabsで作っています。"

#: interface
#. Page shown for an address that does not exist.
msgctxt "ui.missing.page"
msgid "Not found"
msgstr "見つかりません"

#: interface
#. Page shown for an address that does not exist.
msgctxt "ui.missing.title"
msgid "Nothing at this address"
msgstr "このアドレスには何もありません"

#: interface
#. Page shown for an address that does not exist. Keep the words in curly brackets as they are.
msgctxt "ui.missing.text"
msgid "There is no hall or piece at this address. {a}Go back to the entrance{/a} or {b}look in the index{/b}."
msgstr "このアドレスには展示室も展示品もありません。{a}入口へ戻る{/a}か、{b}索引で探して{/b}ください。"

#: interface
#. About page.
msgctxt "ui.about.app"
msgid "The museum as an app"
msgstr "アプリとして使う"

#: interface
#. About page.
msgctxt "ui.about.app.1"
msgid "The museum can be installed as an app. It then opens from an icon of its own, in a window of its own, and keeps itself up to date. Every label and every model is kept on the device, and so is each picture you have seen, so the museum opens without a connection. Sound and film still need one."
msgstr "この博物館はアプリとしてインストールできます。インストールすると、専用のアイコンから専用のウインドウで開き、自動で最新の状態に保たれます。すべてのラベルとモデル、そして一度見た画像は端末に保存されるので、接続がなくても博物館を開けます。音声と映像には、引き続き接続が必要です。"

#: interface
#. About page.
msgctxt "ui.about.app.install"
msgid "Install the app"
msgstr "アプリをインストール"

#: interface
#. About page.
msgctxt "ui.about.app.ios"
msgid "On an iPhone or iPad, tap Share in Safari, then Add to Home Screen."
msgstr "iPhoneやiPadでは、Safariで「共有」をタップし、続けて「ホーム画面に追加」をタップします。"

#: interface
#. About page.
msgctxt "ui.about.keep"
msgid "The whole museum without a connection"
msgstr "接続なしで博物館のすべてを"

#: interface
#. About page.
msgctxt "ui.about.keep.1"
msgid "The museum keeps each picture you have seen. You can fetch them all now, so that every page opens without a connection. The voice of the guided tour is kept apart, one language at a time. Archive films are not kept."
msgstr "この博物館は、ご覧になった画像を端末に保存します。いますべての画像をまとめて取得しておけば、どのページも接続なしで開けます。ガイドツアーの音声は別に、言語ごとに保存します。資料の映像は保存されません。"

#: interface
#. About page. Keep the words in curly brackets as they are.
msgctxt "ui.about.keep.pictures"
msgid "Keep every picture, {mb} MB"
msgstr "すべての画像を保存する（{mb} MB）"

#: interface
#. About page. Keep the words in curly brackets as they are.
msgctxt "ui.about.keep.sound"
msgid "Keep the voice of the guide in this language, {mb} MB"
msgstr "この言語のガイド音声を保存する（{mb} MB）"

#: interface
#. About page. Keep the words in curly brackets as they are.
msgctxt "ui.about.keep.going"
msgid "Fetching: {n} of {of}"
msgstr "取得中: {n}/{of}"

#: interface
#. About page.
msgctxt "ui.about.keep.pictures.done"
msgid "Every picture is on this device."
msgstr "すべての画像がこの端末にあります。"

#: interface
#. About page.
msgctxt "ui.about.keep.sound.done"
msgid "The voice of the guide is on this device, in this language."
msgstr "この言語のガイド音声がこの端末にあります。"

#: interface
#. About page. Keep the words in curly brackets as they are.
msgctxt "ui.about.keep.failed"
msgid "{n} files could not be fetched. Try again when the connection is better."
msgstr "{n}個のファイルを取得できませんでした。接続のよいときにもう一度お試しください。"

#: interface
#. Interface.
msgctxt "ui.visit.kind"
msgid "Short visit"
msgstr "短い見学"

#: interface
#. Interface.
msgctxt "ui.visit.title"
msgid "Three pieces in three minutes"
msgstr "3分で見る3つの展示品"

#: interface
#. Interface.
msgctxt "ui.visit.lead"
msgid "One display that moves real flaps, one that makes its own light and one that borrows the light of the room."
msgstr "本物のフラップを動かすもの、自分で光るもの、周囲の光を借りるもの。"

#: interface
#. Interface. Keep the words in curly brackets as they are.
msgctxt "ui.visit.step"
msgid "Short visit, {n} of {of}"
msgstr "短い見学 {n}/{of}"

#: interface
#. Interface. Keep the words in curly brackets as they are.
msgctxt "ui.visit.next"
msgid "Next: {name}"
msgstr "次へ: {name}"

#: interface
#. Interface.
msgctxt "ui.visit.finish"
msgid "Finish the visit"
msgstr "見学を終える"

#: interface
#. Interface.
msgctxt "ui.visit.leave"
msgid "Leave the visit"
msgstr "見学をやめる"

#: interface
#. Interface.
msgctxt "ui.visit.note.1"
msgid "Nothing here makes light. Every character is a pair of real flaps, and the board holds its message with no power at all. What it gives up: it shows only what is printed on its flaps."
msgstr "ここでは何も光りません。文字はどれも本物のフラップ2枚でできていて、まったく電力を使わずに表示を保ちます。その代わり、フラップに印刷されたものしか表示できません。"

#: interface
#. Interface.
msgctxt "ui.visit.note.2"
msgid "Here every point makes its own light. Switch the daylight off: the black parts of the panel disappear into the dark and the colours stay. What it gives up: lit pixels age, so a still picture leaves a ghost."
msgstr "ここでは点の一つひとつが自分で光ります。日光を消してください。パネルの黒い部分は闇に消え、色だけが残ります。その代わり、点灯した画素は劣化するので、動かない映像は跡を残します。"

#: interface
#. Interface.
msgctxt "ui.visit.note.3"
msgid "This page makes no light. It borrows the light of the room, like print, and uses power only to change the page. Switch the daylight off: the page is still there, but you cannot read it."
msgstr "このページは光りません。印刷物のように周囲の光を借り、電力を使うのはページを変えるときだけです。日光を消してください。ページはそこにありますが、読めません。"

#: interface
#. Interface. Keep the words in curly brackets as they are.
msgctxt "ui.visit.end.title"
msgid "That was three of {n}"
msgstr "{n}点のうちの3点でした"

#: interface
#. Interface.
msgctxt "ui.visit.end.1"
msgid "Every piece in the museum chooses where the light of its picture comes from, and gives something up for that choice. Each label says what its piece is good at and where it fails."
msgstr "館内の展示品はどれも、映像の光をどこから得るかを選び、その選択のために何かをあきらめています。どのラベルにも、その展示品の得意なことと苦手なことが書いてあります。"

#: interface
#. Interface.
msgctxt "ui.visit.end.2"
msgid "The other pieces stand in seven halls. Walk through them, or look one up in the index."
msgstr "ほかの展示品は7つの展示室にあります。歩いて見るか、索引で探してください。"

#: interface
#. About page.
msgctxt "ui.about.licence"
msgid "Licence"
msgstr "ライセンス"

#: interface
#. About page. Keep the words in curly brackets as they are.
msgctxt "ui.about.licence.1"
msgid "The museum's own texts and models are by {name}. They may be shared and adapted under {a}Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0{/a}. Credit {name} and the Museum of Alternative Displays with a link, say what you changed, and share your version under the same licence."
msgstr "この博物館が独自に作った文章と模型の作者は {name} です。{a}クリエイティブ・コモンズ 表示 - 継承 4.0{/a} のもとで共有し、改変することができます。{name} と Museum of Alternative Displays の名前とリンクを示し、変更した点を明らかにし、新しい版も同じライセンスで公開してください。"

#: interface
#. About page.
msgctxt "ui.about.licence.2"
msgid "The licence does not cover the portraits, the recordings of the tour or the archive pictures and films. Each archive picture keeps the licence named in its credit."
msgstr "肖像画、ガイドツアーの録音、資料の写真と映像には、このライセンスは及びません。資料の写真には、それぞれのクレジットに書かれたライセンスが適用されます。"

#: interface
