msgctxt "ui.about.changed"
msgid "Last changed on {date}."
msgstr "{date}に最後の変更を行いました。"

#: interface
#. About page. Keep the words in curly brackets as they are.
msgctxt "ui.about.author"
msgid "Made by {name}."
msgstr "制作は {name} です。"

